WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:35.340
Good!

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.310
Look, it's S4!

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:49.820
I applied to Four Star Academy because I wanted to be like them!

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:59.660
<i>They're just like I was last year.</i>

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:03.750
Yume, we must be going.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:04.580
Sure!

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:08.750
We're already pushing for time.

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.460
<i>I wonder what this year will bring.</i>

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.210
Sorry about that.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.260
Goodness, you haven't changed a bit. Come on.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:13.260
<i>I'm so giddy, I can't contain my excitement!</i>

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.740
Good day, Japan. {still thinking about how to gokigenyou}{rule of thumb number like, twelve, is that if you're not sure what to translate it as, use good day}

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.500
A new age of Aikatsu dawns.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:50.750
Wait for me, idols of the world.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:52.710
I, Elza Forte...

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.880
Will plunder you all! {she is, I kid you not, a pirate}{no, she literally means them}

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:36.070
S4 Presents: It's Our Job to Shine!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.980
We'll be your hosts...

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.990
Flower Song Class, Nijino Yume!

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.990
Bird Theater Class, Saotome Ako!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.240
Wind Dance Class, Nikaidou Yuzu!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:50.120
Moon Beauty Class, Kasumi Mahiru.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:55.750
We are the four glimmering stars, S4!

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.720
Just about a month has passed since we joined S4.

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:04.340
I'm still feeling kind of nervous.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:09.310
The new students have sorted into their classes and begun their Aikatsu in earnest. {you mixed transative and intransative}

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:12.100
There are fresh idols everywhere you look!

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:16.400
We recently received a letter from one of our younger fans.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.610
"I want to be an idol too.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:22.860
Please teach me all about Four Star Academy", she says!

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.450
Let's hop right into it!

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:27.990
Here we go!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.120
Aikatsu!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:31.910
Land!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.870
We've arrived at Four Star Academy!

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:39.380
Today, we've invited a few little future idols along.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:41.010
Hello!

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.550
Ask us about anything you would like. There's no need to hold back.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.970
Okay!

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:56.020
Idols at Four Star Academy work hard every day to light up the stage with their performances.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:05:00.400
They prepare with physical exercise, plus lessons for singing, dancing, modeling, and acting.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.360
Look, it's S4!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.530
They're gorgeous!

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:08.990
This is the Fitting Room. {I feel as though I'd normally capitalize it, but they'll never say it again}{might as well do it anyway}

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:11.620
It's where we enter the stage from.

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:17.250
First you set your Student ID into the Aikatsu System, then you insert your dress and accessory cards.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:22.800
Once you've changed into a coord that suits you, the show begins!

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:30.640
Pulling off the best performance you can in your favorite dress makes me so happy I can't contain my excitement!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.770
This concludes today's lesson.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:34.890
Thank you very much.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:38.150
I'm definitely going to go to Four Star Academy!

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:45.030
That feeling of wanting to be like an idol you admire is an important first step of your idol activities.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:48.410
A cheer for everyone's Aikatsu!

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:49.910
Yay!

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.500
Today's shoot was so much fun.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.790
Next on the schedule...

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:04.010
Yume, I think you've got a press conference for announcing your new brand.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:06.050
We'll accompany you for the occasion.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.180
Yuzu's in the mood for ice cream!

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:12.180
Huh? But Yuzu-senpai, you have your student council president work...

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:13.220
Pardon.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.810
Lily-senpai.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:18.310
I have come to pick Yuzu up.

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:20.560
You can find her right...

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:21.980
Wait, what?

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.820
When did she slip out?

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:27.070
Do not concern yourselves. I was expecting this.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:33.780
Hey, wait just a—

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.080
Fire!

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:52.300
Captured by Lilienne again!{wait, what? missed line or what?}{er, uh, I guess?}

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:53.640
W-Whoa...

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.930
I suppose this is proof of their long friendship.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:04.570
I would like to reveal the name of the new brand I will be the muse of.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.110
Berry Parfait!

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:16.080
Keep your eyes open for a line of dresses filled 
with dreams, made to bring a smile to your face.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:21.620
I'm currently designing a dress with my mark on it.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:25.340
Please look forward to it!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.840
Good work, Yume.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.630
Thanks, Rola.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.550
The place was packed.{if you must standing room, use "it was standing room-only in there"}

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:38.350
Well, you still pale in comparison to me, 
but I must applaud your results.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.350
Is that...

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.600
Were you thinking up designs?

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:44.860
Yeah, I was trying to come up with a Premium Rare Dress,

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.650
but it's not turning out right.{if you're gonna reverse them at least this}

00:07:56.330 --> 00:08:00.620
<i>Come to think of it, Koharu-chan had a real knack for art.{definitely didn't qc this in}</i>

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:03.420
Design is pretty difficult.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:07.380
Koharu was good at stuff like this.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:09.710
Yeah!

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.970
Premium Rare Dresses are very special pieces of clothing.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.640
The time investment reflects its weight.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:21.140
Once you get your own brand, 
there's so much more put on your table.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:24.650
I inherited Romance Kiss from my sister.

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:29.980
I've had to create designs and themes for the brand and debut the new dresses.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:33.320
And that's on top of being the main model for Aikatsu Style Girls.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:37.320
Yep, that just means we have to step up our game!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:40.830
Ako, you'll be announcing your own brand soon, right?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.620
Yes, and here's a sneak peek.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:48.500
A yet-unreleased brand came to me with an offer to be their representative!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.840
That gets me going!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:53.010
So this is going to be your new brand!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:56.090
The brand is called FuwaFuwa Dream.

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:59.930
Our announcement is soon, so look forward to it!

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:05.730
Huh? Momoko-sensei?

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:05.730
Yachigusa Momoko

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.400
Yes, hello?

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.690
Right, yes.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:10.570
Yes...

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.610
What?!

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.360
It can't be!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.530
O-Okay...

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.660
Yes, I-I understand.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.500
Wh-What happened, Ako-chan?

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:32.510
F-FuwaFuwa Dream just announced... a contract with another idol...

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:36.050
I don't get it either!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:40.930
Anyway, this means that some random idol out there stole my brand from under my nose!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.220
Is this it?

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:48.400
I'm the muse of the new brand, FuwaFuwa Dream!

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.020
My name is Hanazono Kirara.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.230
Kiraran! {this is what I'm doing}{this : that :: brandon belt : first baseman}

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:54.820
Peoples, if you don't cheer for Kirara...

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.700
Bleh! {dunno man}{sure I guess}{this may be "baa", we'll fix it later}

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:57.950
"Bleh"...

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.240
Shove it down your throat!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.700
Who's this girl?

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:04.950
She's from New Zealand, 
and quite the popular idol abroad.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.960
It says she's part of "Venus Ark".

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.500
Venus Ark?

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.210
I've never heard of them.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:16.840
That doesn't matter! I must take back 
my brand using any means necessary!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:20.640
Watch your back, Hanazono Kirara!

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:33.230
Just as with your previous invitation, my answer stays the same.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:35.730
How unfortunate.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:40.740
I had hoped we'd be able to share the same dream.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:43.740
What is your dream?

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:48.250
To perfectly be the best in the world.{okay, I don't know what I was doing here. wait, yes I do}

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:52.630
For that, I must obtain every first-rate idol and brand in the world.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:57.630
Then I will make my brand, 
Perfect Queen, the best in the world.

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:01.890
She who controls the dresses controls Aikatsu.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:06.970
As someone with a brand of your own, 
you should understand their importance well.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.650
I'm sorry.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:16.650
It doesn't seem as though I'll be able to sail the same boat as you.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.780
How very intriguing.

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.580
Will you give up, Elza?

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:25.910
Hardly.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:28.910
I was fully expecting a refusal.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:34.670
With time, I will obtain her as well. To that end...

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:37.670
There is a different idol I must first plunder.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:57.980
This is... Venus Ark?

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.190
Wh—it's a ship!

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.360
It's an idol school on a boat?!

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.990
I-In any case, let's board it.

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:06.280
O-Okay.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.130
Whoa, what is all this?

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:26.140
This... gets me going.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.640
So pretty!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:30.640
N-Not bad, in my opinion.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:34.650
Ladies, are you here for a tour of the school?

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.520
Y-Yes...

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.900
Um, is this an idol school?

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.780
Indeed it is.

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:50.910
Here at Venus Ark, only those idols acknowledged by Elza-sama are permitted to board. {come on deck}{9}

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:51.790
Elza?

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:56.880
Excuse me, we're looking for an idol named Hanazono Kirara-chan.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:13:00.630
Yes, Kirara-sama is certainly one of our idols—

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.510
Please call her here at once!

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:03.300
Well...

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:05.800
I am afraid it is not that simple.

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:09.390
Enough excuses! Just make Hanazono Kirara show her face this instant!

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:10.600
You ask the impossible.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.310
What's up, Mahiru?

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:15.810
It smells like Onee-chan in here.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:20.690
No way. Yozora-senpai couldn't possibly be here, could she?

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.070
Where's Elza-sama? {AAAHHHHHHHHHHH}

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.860
She's on land right now.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:25.950
Rola?

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:27.410
Just now...

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.330
Unhand me!

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:32.040
No.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.620
Don't you "no" me!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:40.590
Ladies, I am terribly sorry, but I must ask that you return only after making a proper appointment.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:39.170
I said to unhand me at once!

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:40.590
No.

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:43.090
We will be waiting.

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:46.510
O-Okay...

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.640
We got thrown out.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:55.270
But we were able to determine our enemy's base of operations.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:58.100
After our strategic retreat we should consult the headmaster.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.610
That voice...

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:12.410
Good day to you. It's a pleasure.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:15.910
Your reputation precedes you.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.920
Excuse our intrusion.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.930
Yume Nijino!

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.560
U-Um...

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.940
I've come to plunder you.

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:46.490
Hey, what's the big idea?

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:47.820
Don't be rude!

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:54.080
I'm Elza Forte, Venus Ark's owner and top idol.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.580
Venus Ark?!

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.750
Owner and top idol?

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.830
Which makes you our enemy's supreme commander!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:03.880
Um, I don't get what you mean by saying you came to plunder me.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.000
She's scouting you.

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:10.720
Nice to meet you. I'm Elza's secretary, Kizaki Rei.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:11.840
Let's get along.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:15.720
Venus Ark collects idols from around the world.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:19.230
Do you want to take on the world stage with us?

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.230
What? Why me?

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:25.480
I've heard that Hime Shiratori thinks highly of you as an idol.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:31.110
Sorry, but I can't. I have no intention of leaving Four Star Academy.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:36.030
I wonder if witnessing my performance won't change your tune.

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:42.370
I'll show you the Aikatsu of a new world.

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:57.510
What is going on? Why have you invited not just students, but also the general public?

00:15:57.510 --> 00:15:59.520
What's happening here?

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:04.810
In light of what's to come, it is best that everyone sees her perform.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.400
See who?

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:08.480
Perfect Elza.

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:11.900
The idol pirate who plunders all.{I'm just gonna for now}

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.420
<i>The Blooming Queen Coord.</i>

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:33.180
<i>Blooming with magnificent flowers, it is a Premium Rare Dress fit for a queen.</i>

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:38.060
<i>And the Star Wings are the mark of a Star Premium Coord. {first, capitalize star wings? it's the main thing of the season}{yeah, I think we've been too light on capitalization before}</i>

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.480
Dresses strengthen me. {singular? or we can do something like 'dresses are made/designed to make me stronger}{I think this shouuuld fine?}{even if she's talking about this one, should be fine. also I would've used "the"}

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.420
For I am perfect!{I know it's more like "I am, by nature, perfect" but I think this betters}

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:57.880
Her dress has wings?

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:13.150
That was a perfect performance.

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:17.230
Her Premium Rare Dress was unbelievably extravagant and radiant.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:21.150
She is known as Perfect Elza around the world.

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:22.490
Perfect?

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:27.080
Her dress, song, and dance are all absolutely perfect.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:29.490
Wow, she sounds cool!

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:36.130
The wings upon her coord are symbols of perfection.

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:41.380
Hime-senpai!

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:43.680
Yume-chan.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.850
So you came to watch.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.010
Yes.

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:51.770
Elza-chan had invited me to join her on the Venus Ark.{it's the name of their school but this is cool 2}

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:54.270
I'm glad I came.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:21:01.490
Her dress was more dazzling than anything I've ever seen before, and it accentuated her natural allure.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:06.660
Not even the pinnacle of the Aikatsu we know today could hope to surpass her.

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:10.660
She who controls the dresses controls Aikatsu.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:12.160
As of this moment...

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:15.370
She is the greatest idol in the world.

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.000
In the world?

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.090
Does that mean—

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.720
Does that mean... better than you?

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:30.180
What did you think of Elza's performance?

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:32.680
Rei-san, Elza-san.

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:37.190
You've been chosen by Elza. This is your chance to take flight to the world.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:41.690
B-But I still have things to accomplish in S4.

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:47.200
Yume, you still lack something vital as an idol. {if only mikansei}

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.450
Come with me.

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:55.210
I will make you perfect.

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:00.210
S...

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:03.670
Sorry, but I really can't go with you!

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:16.230
<i>The world is full of amazing idols.</i>

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:20.940
<i>What kind of Aikatsu is waiting for me in the future?</i>

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:59.950
Elza-san's Star Premium Rare Coord was lovely!

00:23:59.950 --> 00:24:04.170
Yeah! Star Wings have brought with them new Aikatsu!

00:24:04.170 --> 00:24:08.510
Let's aim to become the first-star idol with our eyes on a new goal!

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:12.010
Yume, are you okay?!

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:14.470
Are you going to get plundered by that Elza person?

00:24:14.470 --> 00:24:17.970
No, it's our turn to show her our power now.

00:24:17.970 --> 00:24:20.140
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.140 --> 00:24:21.980
Idol Under Pursuit.

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:24.100
Become the first-star idol!
